{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a2-california-disneyland-day/audio/main-2e0a906095c4.mp3","durationSec":202.56,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":3.06,"text":"Disneyland in California is not just one park."},{"start":3.44,"end":5.66,"text":"It is a big resort with many parts."},{"start":6.22,"end":10.3,"text":"It has two parks, Disneyland Park and Disney California Adventure."},{"start":11.06,"end":14.7,"text":"It also has Downtown Disney, a shopping and dining area."},{"start":15.38,"end":16.98,"text":"There are three hotels too."},{"start":17.54,"end":24.12,"text":"They are the Disneyland Hotel, Disney's Grand Californian Hotel & Spa and Pixar Place Hotel."},{"start":24.94,"end":27.86,"text":"Pixar Place Hotel got its new name in 2024."},{"start":28.72,"end":31.78,"text":"Before your day, decide which park you want to visit."},{"start":31.78,"end":34.56,"text":"Tickets work differently now than in the past."},{"start":35.36,"end":38.12,"text":"Before 1982, guests paid to go in."},{"start":38.6,"end":41.64,"text":"Then they paid again for each ride with special tickets."},{"start":42.28,"end":45.34,"text":"These ride tickets had letters, from A to C."},{"start":46.02,"end":51.7,"text":"Since 1982, one admission price lets you use most attractions as often as you like."},{"start":52.2,"end":53.5,"text":"This makes the day simpler."},{"start":53.94,"end":55.74,"text":"You pay once and then you ride."},{"start":56.4,"end":57.68,"text":"Where should you get your ticket?"},{"start":58.42,"end":61.78,"text":"You can get park tickets from the official Disneyland Resort website."},{"start":62.48,"end":65.3,"text":"This is a safe choice because it comes straight from Disney."},{"start":66.14,"end":67.74,"text":"Some rides have long lines."},{"start":68.24,"end":70.84,"text":"The normal line is called the standby line."},{"start":71.58,"end":73.6,"text":"Disney sells Lightning Lane passes."},{"start":74.26,"end":78.54,"text":"With these, you can skip the standby line at some rides, so you save time."},{"start":79.24,"end":80.66,"text":"Not every ride has this."},{"start":81.36,"end":83.68,"text":"Prices can change, so do not guess."},{"start":84.2,"end":86.54,"text":"Check the official website before you buy."},{"start":86.54,"end":90.44,"text":"Inside the park, the staff can help you with many things."},{"start":90.96,"end":92.76,"text":"A common question is about food."},{"start":93.48,"end":95.72,"text":"Some restaurants are table-service restaurants."},{"start":96.28,"end":99.2,"text":"This means you sit down, and a server brings your food."},{"start":99.76,"end":101.16,"text":"These places can be busy."},{"start":101.78,"end":103.1,"text":"So how do you get a table?"},{"start":103.7,"end":105.5,"text":"The Disneyland app can help."},{"start":105.96,"end":109.94,"text":"At some table-service restaurants, you can add your group to a walk-up list."},{"start":110.42,"end":113.1,"text":"You can do this only if the restaurant has space."},{"start":113.78,"end":116.04,"text":"You can check if there is space in two ways."},{"start":116.52,"end":121.18,"text":"You can look in the app, or you can scan a QR code near the restaurant entrance."},{"start":121.82,"end":123.78,"text":"You do not need to go to the host stand."},{"start":124.3,"end":127.9,"text":"The host stand is the desk at the front, where staff welcome guests."},{"start":128.56,"end":130.48,"text":"This is helpful for food needs too."},{"start":131.1,"end":134.88,"text":"When you add your group to the list, you can confirm details in the app."},{"start":135.32,"end":138.52,"text":"You can also tell the restaurant about special dietary needs."},{"start":138.52,"end":142.36,"text":"For example, maybe someone in your group cannot eat eggs."},{"start":142.92,"end":144.2,"text":"You can write this in the app."},{"start":144.76,"end":147.68,"text":"You do not need to explain it out loud in a busy place."},{"start":148.5,"end":150.34,"text":"What if the restaurant has no space?"},{"start":150.88,"end":152.84,"text":"Or what if you just want a quick meal?"},{"start":153.52,"end":157.4,"text":"You can use the Disneyland app to order food and drinks ahead of time."},{"start":157.88,"end":160.1,"text":"This works at some dining places in the park."},{"start":160.72,"end":162.78,"text":"Here is how it works, step by step."},{"start":163.4,"end":165.02,"text":"First, you choose a restaurant."},{"start":165.56,"end":167.34,"text":"Next, you pick an arrival time."},{"start":167.78,"end":170.42,"text":"This is the time you plan to come and get your food."},{"start":171.2,"end":172.68,"text":"Then you customize your order."},{"start":173.1,"end":174.44,"text":"That means you can change it."},{"start":174.82,"end":177.76,"text":"For example, you can take out something you do not want."},{"start":178.42,"end":179.42,"text":"Last, you pay."},{"start":179.9,"end":184.1,"text":"There are several ways to pay, including a Disney Gift Card and Apple Pay."},{"start":184.64,"end":187,"text":"The app can do more outside the parks too."},{"start":187.5,"end":191.8,"text":"If you stay at a Disneyland hotel, you can order meals and snacks in the app."},{"start":192.18,"end":194.68,"text":"Then you pick them up at some hotel locations."},{"start":195.2,"end":198.96,"text":"You can also choose some Downtown Disney restaurants and see their food."},{"start":199.58,"end":202.12,"text":"Some of them can deliver your order to a hotel lobby."}],"words":[{"text":"Disneyland","start":0,"end":0.5},{"text":"in","start":0.5,"end":0.8},{"text":"California","start":0.8,"end":1.3},{"text":"is","start":1.3,"end":1.76},{"text":"not","start":1.76,"end":2.1},{"text":"just","start":2.1,"end":2.34},{"text":"one","start":2.34,"end":2.68},{"text":"park","start":2.68,"end":3.06},{"text":"It","start":3.44,"end":3.58},{"text":"is","start":3.58,"end":3.7},{"text":"a","start":3.7,"end":3.94},{"text":"big","start":3.94,"end":4.16},{"text":"resort","start":4.16,